Good morning,

Please prepare a short timeline for the incident briefing. We have the
initial community records and the clinical alert. We have a preliminary result
from the environmental laboratory.

The municipality received a report on 15 December of elevated E. coli and
coliform counts in water samples from the affected apartment building
(APT-01). The advice to boil tap water went out that day. On 16 December
we advised residents in the affected area to stop using tap water and
arranged an alternative supply. That restriction is still in place.

Public health: please bring the alert records and what we need to check
with the day-care centre.
Network operations: please confirm whether recent works caused any pressure
drops, when they occurred and what area the affected main supplied.

We will review the full water sample results with the environmental team.

Municipal incident coordinator
